.TH cmux 1  "cmux 0.1.8"
.SH NAME
cmux \- Control cmux terminal multiplexer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcmux\fR [\fB\-\-socket\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-json\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control cmux terminal multiplexer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR \fI<SOCKET>\fR
Path to the cmux socket (overrides discovery)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output raw JSON responses
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-json\fR
Suppress JSON output for browser commands (browser defaults to JSON)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose output (connection info to stderr)
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color mode: always, never, auto
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
